#
# What it demonstrates, in order: a duplicated scalar item; an item with no value; a `loop_` whose
# last row is short of its header; an atom with no element stated; a non-numeric coordinate; an
# occupancy outside 0..1; a 5-character component id (which is NOT damage -- wwPDB issues them, and
# no field here has a width); a `value_order` chython holds no bond for; a `_struct_conn` row naming
# an atom that is not in the model; a hydrogen bond; and a partner under a symmetry operator whose
# image is not among the deposited coordinates.
#
